<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabobank sets 200 billion lire bond due 2008.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 200 billion lire bond due 2008.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Rabobank Nederland :</p>
<p>BORROWER RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT 200 BLN LIRE     COUPON 7.375	   MATURITY 20.DEC.2008</p>
<p> TYPE STR		 ISS PRICE 101.58     PAY DATE 20.DEC.1996</p>
<p> LISTING  AMS	   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS  US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEFLT		FORCE MAJ    IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW  NETHS	 HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS    STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND  0.50	  SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIP	NONE</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
